<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE 50 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</title>
<headline>TALLINN WATER TO ISSUE 50 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn Water will issue 50 million kroons in commercial papers on August 6, Hansapank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The papers mature in three months and yield 6.8 percent, the bank's interest rate products manager Ulo Kallas told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
